ズ制作&ネットプリント等）\n・自身のTwitterやアイコンに使用\n・おはV等自身の宣伝画像に使用\n・IRIAM内での配信サムネイル使用（収益化済)\n・イベント入賞の際の雑誌掲載や駅ポス掲載\n\n【キャラクター参考資料】\n\n1人目\n【https://x.com/towa_masiro39/status/1851658082570670263?s=46&t=Pf4cHZjKVNld5LI3ThIBmw】\n\n2人目\n【https://x.com/towa_masiro39/status/1719029945727701281?s=46&t=Pf4cHZjKVNld5LI3ThIBmw】\n\n文面が読みずらく纏まっておらずほんとに申し訳ございません。お忙しいと思いますが、ご検討よろしくお願いします。", "nc": 16, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@ruto_irai_/works/2", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/97a59e8a/uploads/origins/a9bc2051-044a-46f9-804e-b6d2d5308716?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=f9fc55548d7cfc048dc840cdbe41390f", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/97a59e8a/uploads/origins/a9bc2051-044a-46f9-804e-b6d2d5308716?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=f9fc55548d7cfc048dc840cdbe41390f, https://si.imgix.net/97a59e8a/uploads/origins/a9bc2051-044a-46f9-804e-b6d2d5308716?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=558167ce813cf47632cd8f0b5369a88e 2x, https://si.imgix.net/97a59e8a/uploads/origins/a9bc2051-044a-46f9-804e-b6d2d5308716?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=46b1358495ad01a602751b1b223b62cd 3x"}, "private": true, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 3314906, "client_id": 2107511, "nc": 0}, {"path": "/@ruto_irai_/works/1", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 3314906, "client_id": 2001459, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_